// Outfits, drawn over body/base (body.sprite) in the same 25 x 35 frame. Only rows 21 to 31 carry cloth: a standing
// frame is those eleven rows, and a step frame redraws the rows that move (the legs on the stepping side). The feet
// (rows 32 to 34) belong to the body, and no cloth covers a sole. Main colour p q r, trim t u v, accent x y z (a belt,
// a badge), metal k l n, leather o O (boots and belts). Hems end on an ink line. Inner seams use a darker shade.

